---
import B from './TirfText.astro';
import { guPractices } from '../../data/tirfGu';
const nodes = [...guPractices, {ai:'Ask AI to restate the target for your students and suggest what you could look for in their work. Check that it matches your teaching aim.', aiZh:'請AI用學生易懂的語言重述目標，建議可在作品中看甚麼；核對它是否符合你的教學目的。', key:'targets', en:'Learning target', zh:'學習目標', explanation:'The target remains the reference point in every practice.', explanationZh:'每項實踐均以學習目標為參照。', example:'A specific relevant example, plus an explanation linking it to the opinion. Look for the example and explanation when choosing a task, interpreting a response and deciding the next step.', exampleZh:'本寫作任務的目標：提供具體相關的例子，並解釋它與觀點的聯繫。選擇任務、詮釋作答及決定下一步時，都看這兩個重點。'}];
---
<div class="framework-flow" aria-label="Formative purpose, formative practice and formative effect">
 <div class="framework-context"><span data-language="en">Formative purpose</span><span data-language="zh" lang="zh-Hant" hidden>形成性目的</span><small><span data-language="en">Use evidence to support learning</span><span data-language="zh" lang="zh-Hant" hidden>運用證據支持學習</span></small></div>
 <div class="framework-boundary"><h3><span data-language="en">Formative practice</span><span data-language="zh" lang="zh-Hant" hidden>形成性實踐</span></h3><p class="framework-mobile-key"><span data-language="en">Targets connect with every practice. Follow the cycle, revisiting evidence when needed.</span><span data-language="zh" lang="zh-Hant" hidden>目標連結每項實踐。循環進行，並按需要重看證據。</span></p>
  <div class="practice-cycle">
   <svg class="framework-arrows" viewBox="0 0 660 420" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><defs><marker id="tirf-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#1f6b45" /></marker></defs><g fill="none" stroke="#1f6b45" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#tirf-arrow)"><path d="M400 60 Q565 60 565 150"/><path d="M565 270 Q565 360 400 360"/><path d="M260 360 Q95 360 95 270"/><path d="M95 150 Q95 60 260 60"/></g><g stroke="#1f6b45" stroke-width="1.8" marker-start="url(#tirf-arrow)" marker-end="url(#tirf-arrow)"><path d="M330 125V167"/><path d="M330 253V295"/><path d="M205 210H241"/><path d="M419 210H455"/></g></svg>
   {nodes.map(({key,en,zh})=><button type="button" class={`framework-node node-${key}`} data-framework={key} aria-pressed={key==='targets'} aria-controls="framework-detail"><span data-language="en">{en}</span><span data-language="zh" lang="zh-Hant" hidden>{zh}</span></button>)}
  </div>
 </div>
 <div class="framework-context"><span data-language="en">Formative effect</span><span data-language="zh" lang="zh-Hant" hidden>形成性效果</span><small><span data-language="en">Evaluate whether learning benefits</span><span data-language="zh" lang="zh-Hant" hidden>檢視是否促進學習</span></small></div>
</div>
<p class="source-note"><span data-language="en">Select a practice or the central target to see its meaning and classroom example.</span><span data-language="zh" lang="zh-Hant" hidden>點選各項實踐或中央目標，查看解釋與課堂例子。</span></p>
<div id="framework-detail" class="takeaway" aria-live="polite">{nodes.map(({key,en,zh,explanation,explanationZh,example,exampleZh,ai,aiZh})=><div data-framework-detail={key} hidden={key!=='targets'}><div data-language="en"><h4>{en}</h4><p>{explanation}</p><p><strong>In our classroom case:</strong> {example}</p><p><strong>AI can help you prepare:</strong> {ai}</p></div><div data-language="zh" lang="zh-Hant" hidden><h4>{zh}</h4><p>{explanationZh}</p><p><strong>本課堂案例：</strong>{exampleZh}</p><p><strong>AI可協助你準備：</strong>{aiZh}</p></div></div>)}</div>
<div data-language="en"><p><strong>Purpose → practice → effect:</strong> intending to help learning, completing the assessment cycle and demonstrating a learning benefit are distinct. One cycle may span lessons; improvement may require several cycles.</p><p><strong>Check the evidence:</strong> a better revision after a hint shows supported performance. A fresh task helps us examine what learners can do with less support and whether our interpretation holds.</p></div><div data-language="zh" lang="zh-Hant" hidden><p><strong>目的 → 實踐 → 效果：</strong>有意支持學習、完成評估循環，以及證實學習受益，三者各有意義。一個循環可跨越課堂，進步也可能需要多個循環。</p><p><strong>核對證據：</strong>提示後的修訂反映有支援時的表現；新任務有助檢視學生在較少支援下能做到甚麼，以及我們的詮釋是否成立。</p></div>
<p class="source-note"><a href="https://doi.org/10.3389/feduc.2021.605999">Gu (2021)</a><B en=", Figure 1 and the section on classroom-based formative assessment." zh="，圖1及課堂形成性評估部分。" /></p>
